WEBVTT

00:13.420 --> 00:14.480
<i>I have no way out!</i>

00:22.750 --> 00:25.240
M-Mil?

00:26.240 --> 00:28.860
P-Prince Mikhail?

00:28.860 --> 00:30.390
Why are you here?

00:31.280 --> 00:34.610
I happened to overhear you two talking.

00:34.920 --> 00:37.500
And I had a bad feeling about it.

00:39.350 --> 00:43.260
I was hoping that my feeling 
wasn't right, though.

00:53.640 --> 00:55.040
It's a shame.

02:26.250 --> 02:30.000
A Path

02:30.250 --> 02:33.390
P-Prince Mikhail, please hear me out!

02:33.390 --> 02:37.390
We took this action for the
the future of the nobles' faction!

02:37.390 --> 02:40.620
Rest assured, the only ones to 
dirty their hands will be us!

02:41.000 --> 02:41.840
So, please—

02:41.840 --> 02:45.030
So Elise has to die? Is that what you mean?

02:45.880 --> 02:47.650
Don't jest with me.

02:47.650 --> 02:50.550
If you harm Lise even in the slightest...

02:50.550 --> 02:51.880
you will not be punished lightly!

02:54.230 --> 02:56.400
What are you losing your nerve for?

02:56.400 --> 03:00.230
If we don't kill that woman, 
we won't get our reward!

03:02.640 --> 03:03.900
Let's do this!

03:03.900 --> 03:04.660
Yeah!

03:23.920 --> 03:24.830
Lise!

03:27.540 --> 03:30.510
I'm sorry I put you through 
such a terrifying experience.

03:30.940 --> 03:32.330
I'm all right.

03:34.480 --> 03:35.540
Right now...

03:36.450 --> 03:39.520
I must go to His Majesty 
as quickly as possible!

03:42.710 --> 03:45.520
<i>How can you be so strong?</i>

03:47.660 --> 03:50.390
All right. I'll escort you to the hospital.

03:55.830 --> 03:58.020
<i>Please, find a way to help my father.</i>

04:04.400 --> 04:05.940
What is His Majesty's condition?

04:05.940 --> 04:09.800
Systolic blood pressure, 60. Pulse, 160.

04:09.800 --> 04:11.840
Breathing, 35. It's fast.

04:11.840 --> 04:13.920
<i>There are no problems with his lungs.</i>

04:13.920 --> 04:15.680
Were there any abnormalities in his tests?

04:15.680 --> 04:16.670
No.

04:16.670 --> 04:18.670
Everything was normal.

04:18.670 --> 04:19.850
Normal?

04:20.670 --> 04:24.820
<i>And yet he's in shock,
 and his breathing is labored.</i>

04:25.490 --> 04:27.400
What could the problem be?

04:28.260 --> 04:29.750
Increase his drip infusion!

04:29.750 --> 04:31.300
And administer his medicine!

04:31.300 --> 04:32.260
Yes, miss!

04:33.660 --> 04:35.390
<i>We're out of time.</i>

04:35.390 --> 04:39.060
<i>If we don't discover the cause 
right now, His Majesty will...</i>

04:41.300 --> 04:43.590
<i>I won't let that happen!</i>

04:44.440 --> 04:45.580
<i>Back then...</i>

04:46.970 --> 04:50.480
<i>His Majesty had had quite a lot of alcohol.</i>

04:50.890 --> 04:55.060
<i>But there aren't any illnesses which 
react with alcohol to create this state.</i>

04:55.060 --> 04:56.840
<i>Not as far as I know...</i>

04:58.140 --> 05:00.450
<i>Was there anything else out of the ordinary?</i>

05:04.190 --> 05:05.300
It can't be...

05:05.800 --> 05:07.900
There's no reaction to the infusion.

05:07.900 --> 05:09.770
His blood pressure has dropped even further!

05:11.880 --> 05:17.070
Rose, shouldn't we call the crown 
prince and third prince here?

05:17.630 --> 05:20.290
That way, his family will be here 
to watch over him at the end.

05:20.290 --> 05:22.400
Lady Clorence...

05:22.910 --> 05:25.530
you've done everything you possibly could.

05:26.310 --> 05:31.130
And thanks to you, His Majesty has 
managed to hold on this long.

05:32.070 --> 05:36.930
I'm sure that His Majesty... 
will be grateful to you in heaven.

05:38.700 --> 05:42.390
All right. Please call His Highness, 
the crown prince.

05:45.450 --> 05:48.150
And make preparations 
for surgery as well.

05:56.350 --> 05:58.610
Elise, how is my father?

05:59.640 --> 06:01.570
His condition is critical.

06:03.340 --> 06:10.360
However, there is a method that 
might just save His Majesty's life.

06:11.250 --> 06:12.580
What is it?

06:12.940 --> 06:18.180
His Majesty was sitting for the whole 
four hours of the awards ceremony.

06:18.700 --> 06:21.600
That's in spite of the chronic 
illness he suffers from.

06:22.450 --> 06:25.270
Afterwards, he coughed up 
blood, had chest pains,

06:25.270 --> 06:27.600
fell into shock, and developed
 labored breathing.

06:27.600 --> 06:31.200
That's right. But the tests 
all showed no irregularities.

06:31.710 --> 06:37.970
Yes. However, what if a blood clot has 
formed in an artery of the lungs?

06:37.970 --> 06:39.710
It can't be. His Majesty has...

06:42.120 --> 06:43.700
A pulmonary embolism.

06:44.640 --> 06:45.980
I see.

06:46.630 --> 06:48.540
It isn't certain.

06:48.540 --> 06:51.840
It's just a possibility.

06:52.240 --> 06:53.450
<i>That's right.</i>

06:53.450 --> 06:57.500
<i>There's no way to test for a pulmonary 
embolism with the technology of this era.</i>

06:58.250 --> 07:01.520
If it's a pulmonary embolism, we'll 
have to open up the chest, the arteries,

07:01.520 --> 07:05.360
and the heart itself with a 
scalpel to remove the clot.

07:05.840 --> 07:07.010
But...

07:07.610 --> 07:11.660
in His Majesty's current condition, the 
stress of open heart surgery is too great.

07:13.120 --> 07:17.900
And if we expose his heart and 
it isn't a pulmonary embolism...

07:18.560 --> 07:20.150
then there...

07:21.690 --> 07:26.760
<i>As a doctor, if there's even the slightest 
chance, then I want to perform the surgery,</i>

07:26.760 --> 07:30.420
<i>but this isn't something 
I can decide on my own.</i>

07:30.420 --> 07:33.130
<i>I have to respect his family's wishes.</i>

07:33.490 --> 07:37.640
<i>And all the more because 
His Majesty isn't a normal patient.</i>

07:41.870 --> 07:43.520
Please perform the surgery.

07:45.030 --> 07:48.990
If there is a possibility that 
my father might be saved...

07:48.990 --> 07:50.530
Are you certain?

07:52.360 --> 07:54.390
I trust you.

07:57.500 --> 07:59.990
I will do my utmost!

08:12.550 --> 08:14.060
Now, let's begin.

08:20.000 --> 08:21.310
Scalpel, please.

08:25.850 --> 08:28.980
<i>In order to approach the heart 
and pulmonary arteries,</i>

08:28.980 --> 08:31.220
<i>I'll have to cut through the sternum.</i>

08:31.680 --> 08:33.960
Please bring the instrument 
to cut through bone.

08:41.580 --> 08:44.060
<i>Her technique in cutting 
the sternum is perfect.</i>

08:48.790 --> 08:49.890
Scalpel.

08:51.360 --> 08:52.880
<i>Please...</i>

08:54.650 --> 08:55.870
What is it?

08:58.130 --> 09:01.490
There's no clot.

09:02.650 --> 09:04.390
Blood pressure dropping!

09:04.720 --> 09:06.900
<i>As I thought, the blood loss is taxing.</i>

09:07.430 --> 09:10.330
Use your fingers to temporarily
 control the bleeding!

09:10.330 --> 09:12.400
I'll wait for his blood 
circulation to stabilize!

09:12.400 --> 09:13.650
R-Right!

09:17.390 --> 09:19.660
His blood pressure has stabilized.

09:21.530 --> 09:23.160
We should suture him up right away.

09:25.610 --> 09:26.670
Rose?

09:26.670 --> 09:28.020
<i>Not yet.</i>

09:29.910 --> 09:32.930
I have to check the other blood vessels.

09:36.770 --> 09:38.100
<i>I found it!</i>

09:40.440 --> 09:42.560
Long, thin forceps!

09:43.020 --> 09:44.760
There really was one!

09:48.770 --> 09:51.110
Because there was a blood 
clot in a pulmonary artery,

09:51.110 --> 09:53.350
he wasn't able to recover from his shock.

09:56.350 --> 09:59.220
That finishes this surgery. I'll suture—

10:00.720 --> 10:02.550
<i>What is that?</i>

10:04.250 --> 10:05.920
Forceps again.

10:08.760 --> 10:11.500
Rose, what is that mass?

10:11.810 --> 10:14.190
It looks like a lymph gland mass.

10:16.080 --> 10:19.630
Could this be the cause 
of His Majesty's illness?

10:23.160 --> 10:25.870
Losing weight, reduced energy...

10:25.870 --> 10:28.840
and this pulmonary embolism, too...

10:28.840 --> 10:31.640
those are all complications 
seen with lymphoma.

10:32.530 --> 10:37.080
If it's lymphoma, then it explains 
all of His Majesty's symptoms!

10:38.170 --> 10:42.930
I'm so glad! This should alleviate
 His Majesty's symptoms!

10:57.750 --> 10:59.040
<i>Mil.</i>

11:03.710 --> 11:08.020
<i>The power struggle between the nobles' 
faction and the royal faction</i>

11:08.020 --> 11:10.110
<i>will likely continue, unchanged.</i>

11:11.140 --> 11:13.300
<i>But, if someday...</i>

11:13.910 --> 11:16.810
<i>if someday, those two can 
stand together and laugh...</i>

11:20.100 --> 11:21.470
Excuse the intrusion.

11:22.050 --> 11:24.080
Elise! How was the surgery?

11:24.960 --> 11:26.570
It was a success!

11:27.420 --> 11:28.660
Is that true?

11:28.660 --> 11:29.470
Yes!

11:30.570 --> 11:32.650
Lise! Well done!

11:32.650 --> 11:33.850
You're amazing!

11:34.590 --> 11:35.950
I'm so glad!

11:35.950 --> 11:39.960
And with this, the suspicion surrounding 
Crown Prince Linden should be cleared.

11:39.960 --> 11:41.840
Yes! Yes.

11:42.610 --> 11:45.840
I'm sorry. I'll take my leave now.

11:46.350 --> 11:50.360
Don't tell me you mean to go 
to the testing site, Lise.

11:50.360 --> 11:53.330
You just performed that major surgery!

11:53.330 --> 11:56.620
And you haven't slept at all!

11:56.830 --> 11:58.360
Don't push yourself so hard.

11:58.360 --> 12:01.870
You can simply let this test go by, can't you?

12:04.070 --> 12:08.110
No. Thank you for worrying about me,

12:08.110 --> 12:10.790
but I'm all right.

12:11.630 --> 12:14.510
Go and do your best on that test, Rose.

12:15.480 --> 12:16.840
I will!

12:31.740 --> 12:34.380
Prince Linden?

12:35.030 --> 12:37.910
Get in. I'll escort you to the testing site.

12:44.090 --> 12:45.220
Lady Elise.

12:45.220 --> 12:46.410
Y-Yes?

12:47.370 --> 12:51.910
You have my thanks, both as the 
crown prince and as a son.

12:51.910 --> 12:54.600
Oh, no, it wasn't...

12:57.290 --> 13:03.560
It may be difficult for His Majesty to 
perform official functions as he used to.

13:04.660 --> 13:05.910
But...

13:06.300 --> 13:11.100
I'm certain that he'll smile at 
us again, the way he used to.

13:13.500 --> 13:15.950
I see. I see.

13:19.020 --> 13:23.870
I had thought that my father might
 never open his eyes again.

13:30.210 --> 13:31.180
Thank you.

13:40.710 --> 13:43.080
Well then, I'll go now.

13:47.550 --> 13:50.460
However, I absolutely will not give up!

13:50.460 --> 13:52.380
I will become a doctor, 
no matter what it takes.

13:52.960 --> 13:56.260
Until the moment that 
this life of mine ends,

13:56.260 --> 13:59.040
I want to save as many 
lives as I possibly can.

13:59.690 --> 14:00.780
Lady Elise!

14:05.580 --> 14:11.110
Back then, I thought that our paths 
ran counter to each other, but...

14:13.570 --> 14:15.980
Even if we walk different paths,

14:17.320 --> 14:20.810
I hope that one day they will cross again.

14:22.650 --> 14:25.050
I can't stop wishing for that.

14:28.090 --> 14:31.620
Y-Your Highness, what do you mean?

14:31.620 --> 14:35.640
After you've finished your test, let's go 
to Cafe Lait and have a strawberry tart.

14:37.190 --> 14:40.040
Lord Ron? But why...

14:42.400 --> 14:47.330
<i>I've heard that the royal family has a tool 
that allows them to change their appearance.</i>

14:49.530 --> 14:52.760
Prince Linden, could it be that you're...

15:02.470 --> 15:05.470
Please begin the exam.

15:08.950 --> 15:10.180
<i>This is...</i>

15:11.790 --> 15:16.880
<i>These questions are like the ones 
on Japan's NMPQE or the USMLE.</i>

15:17.920 --> 15:21.740
<i>They're all questions concerning 
cases of actual patient treatment.</i>

15:21.740 --> 15:26.820
<i>Incredible! I'd heard that the exam was 
difficult, but not to this extent.</i>

15:27.570 --> 15:28.730
<i>Still...</i>

15:31.780 --> 15:35.870
This time, the subject of discussion 
will be this exam paper.

15:36.120 --> 15:40.950
The reason that questions which hadn't 
been approved yet were used on the test

15:40.950 --> 15:44.750
was to discover how much recent medical 
knowledge the examinees possessed

15:44.750 --> 15:47.770
and also what sorts of ideas 
they held in that area.

15:48.380 --> 15:51.980
As a result, it became 
quite a high-level test,

15:51.980 --> 15:55.200
and the examinees were greatly perplexed.

15:56.260 --> 15:58.460
However, there was one solitary person...

15:59.030 --> 16:02.520
who answered every single question.

16:02.520 --> 16:07.260
Additionally, the answers were 
ones no one has ever thought of before.

16:08.690 --> 16:11.370
For example, in the case of a gastrectomy...

16:11.720 --> 16:15.240
the "gastric Roux-en-Y reconstruction" 
referred to in this answer sheet

16:15.240 --> 16:19.750
would completely prevent 
reflux from the duodenum.

16:19.750 --> 16:23.120
Similarly, in the question of treatment 
for a heart failure patient...

16:23.120 --> 16:25.800
I've labored over this problem for years.

16:25.800 --> 16:29.430
I never imagined it could 
be solved so simply!

16:29.710 --> 16:34.380
The masters of both the empire and the 
Republic of Fresgard have debated for years

16:34.380 --> 16:37.530
and never come to a conclusion 
on any of these questions!

16:38.410 --> 16:41.800
The contents of those answers should, by 
all means, be presented at a conference.

16:43.190 --> 16:47.810
Then we shall deal with these answers 
by treating them as correct.

16:48.460 --> 16:50.080
And what is the final score?

16:50.360 --> 16:51.820
Ninety-eight points.

16:54.560 --> 16:58.560
That would mean that out of a hundred 
answers, only two were wrong.

16:58.560 --> 17:00.710
What were those two questions?

17:00.710 --> 17:04.830
The symptoms of pneumonia and the 
method of treatment for a cold.

17:07.700 --> 17:11.330
Aren't those the easiest questions?

17:11.760 --> 17:13.080
Well...

17:17.660 --> 17:21.270
The answers were written in 
such a disordered hand

17:21.270 --> 17:25.560
they couldn't be read, so they 
were marked as incorrect.

17:26.080 --> 17:28.130
This handwriting is terrible.

17:33.480 --> 17:38.870
In any case, we can be sure that a genius 
has appeared in the Britia Empire!

17:38.870 --> 17:43.600
That splenectomy astonished the 
medical community of Laurage,

17:43.600 --> 17:48.170
and that bold tracheotomy 
saved Duchess Harbour's life.

17:48.170 --> 17:51.000
The young lady who is the 
first woman to receive

17:51.000 --> 17:54.010
the Order of the Imperial Rose and 
an honorary knighthood...

17:54.010 --> 17:56.850
Dame Elise de Clorence!

17:57.750 --> 18:02.010
It could be that we are witnessing 
a most incredible moment!

18:02.300 --> 18:07.280
The moment when a doctor who upends the 
status quo and goes down in history is born!

18:12.030 --> 18:17.230
Lady Elise attended the 
physician's exam and passed?

18:17.230 --> 18:21.280
Yes, and with the highest score in history.

18:23.580 --> 18:29.290
Producing such results when the 
difficulty level was set so high...

18:29.290 --> 18:33.380
I did know that she was 
a clever girl, but this?

18:33.830 --> 18:38.170
Just how much does she 
intend to surprise me?

18:39.770 --> 18:40.730
Come in.

18:42.310 --> 18:43.750
Please excuse the interruption.

18:46.680 --> 18:48.370
Elise.

18:50.750 --> 18:53.050
I'm sorry for coming so suddenly.

18:53.050 --> 18:56.850
I just thought that I'd like to see Your 
Majesty's face before I report for work.

18:57.410 --> 18:59.230
How are you feeling?

18:59.720 --> 19:01.490
Very well.

19:01.490 --> 19:02.870
I'm so glad.

19:03.360 --> 19:06.880
I heard that you passed 
the physician's exam.

19:08.340 --> 19:09.130
Yes.

19:09.430 --> 19:10.880
Honestly...

19:11.620 --> 19:14.580
Everyone was astonished.

19:14.580 --> 19:19.920
They said that your exam results were 
so perfect as to be beyond reproach.

19:19.920 --> 19:21.170
They weren't really.

19:21.640 --> 19:27.890
It seems that my desire to distance 
you from medicine was a mistake.

19:34.490 --> 19:35.990
Elise.

19:38.370 --> 19:42.900
Do you have anything in your 
life which you greatly regret?

19:43.260 --> 19:44.080
What?

19:45.220 --> 19:50.280
I do. I have made the gravest of errors.

19:51.340 --> 19:53.490
That's why I was punished.

19:55.050 --> 19:57.390
A nightmarish punishment...

20:02.840 --> 20:04.440
I have them, too.

20:05.280 --> 20:07.000
All I have are regrets.

20:08.470 --> 20:10.850
Your father and older brother are dead.

20:12.240 --> 20:16.490
All of this is due to your 
mistakes and yours alone.

20:20.770 --> 20:22.020
But, Your Majesty,

20:23.890 --> 20:26.620
there is no such thing as a person 
who hasn't made a single mistake.

20:29.150 --> 20:31.800
If we recognize our mistakes as mistakes,

20:32.250 --> 20:34.260
and truly regret them,

20:34.260 --> 20:38.620
then chose to move forward in spite of them, 
struggling desperately to live on...

20:39.300 --> 20:41.090
that's enough.

20:41.500 --> 20:43.060
That's what I think.

20:45.790 --> 20:47.050
I see.

20:48.130 --> 20:51.530
As I thought, you are a most wonderful lady.

20:52.410 --> 20:55.630
With regards to our wager, I've already—

20:55.630 --> 20:56.460
Your Majesty.

20:57.300 --> 21:01.090
All I've done is pass the physician's exam.

21:01.090 --> 21:04.970
Our wager was for me to prove 
that my work as a doctor

21:04.970 --> 21:08.570
is more valuable than my 
existence as an empress.

21:10.070 --> 21:14.150
In the time frame we agreed to, 
before I come of age,

21:14.150 --> 21:16.720
I will fulfill the conditions of our wager.

21:17.860 --> 21:21.430
The results of our wager 
haven't been decided yet.

21:24.560 --> 21:25.960
Indeed.

21:35.930 --> 21:39.020
<i>I am Elise de Clorence.</i>

21:42.740 --> 21:44.510
<i>I am alive.</i>

21:46.370 --> 21:52.490
<i>I will continue to live for a long 
time in this world as a doctor,</i>

21:52.820 --> 21:57.370
<i>to protect those I love from tragic fates...</i>

21:58.510 --> 22:03.190
<i>and to save as many lives as I possibly can.</i>

22:05.060 --> 22:08.160
Now, we will begin the surgery.
